./LOGBOOK.md:688:- VALIDATION: External scope remains 11 states, 32 transitions, 59 reasons, and five retry classes. Both PlantUML sources passed syntax and deterministic rendering and were visually inspected; ownership PNG SHA-256 is corrected to `928d103099635e71534adf5b70b2b8187d2bd78006b4dd08c4e73ce61ca03c35`. Core 306-test, RelayProtocol 57-test plus protocol/schema, all Go relay packages, and 11 release-test gates pass. M1/M2/M3/UI ownership, production M0/DNS gates, and numeric non-decisions are unchanged.
