./LOGBOOK.md:698:- RETRY/REASON: T15 is the sole same-runtime re-entry after exhaustion or a local-change-required relay result. It accepts only a higher locally authorized relay-only policy generation on the current healthy base, allocates a fresh bounded recovery cycle, and cannot accept remote/UI input or overlap M3 path/host/route/lane/sleep/NAT64/captive ownership. Successful startup activation publishes local finite `activation_ready` with all capabilities false until atomic full publication changes the reason to `none`.
