./LOGBOOK.md:708:- DECISION: Full is exactly current authenticated SSH + mandatory packet/TCP + safe DNS + installed/current settings + a fresh validated live relay generation. Degraded preserves the same mandatory base with UDP admission closed and all retired relay associations invalidated. Failed, stopping, reasserting, stale, corrupt, and unknown projections advertise no usable capability bits.
./LOGBOOK.md:709:- OWNERSHIP: M2 exclusively owns relay bootstrap/session loss and one bounded relay-only reprobe while the current base stays healthy; it remains publicly connected/degraded and never sets provider reasserting. M3 exclusively owns path, host, route, mandatory/lane-pool, sleep/wake, NAT64, and captive reconnect. A current M3 event cancels M2 timers/attempts before any M3 retry loop begins.
