./LOGBOOK.md:742:- DECISION: ADR-022 proposes one required ordered per-profile `dnsResolver` with a non-empty list of canonical numeric IPv4/IPv6 `dns53` endpoints and per-endpoint port default 53. There is no product/public-vendor default, hostname endpoint, physical resolver inheritance, exit-host shell discovery, DoH, or fake-DNS baseline. The earlier one-to-four endpoint ceiling and 5/5/15/10-second, 32/128-query values had no accepted evidence and are removed. New TASK-260721-3miqh4 owns measured endpoint/message/byte/capacity/timing defaults and hard caps; schema, transport, relay, and M4 consumers are blocked on its independently accepted `DNSRuntimePolicyV1`.
