./.research/260721_task-260715-1tnjlu-exit-dns-resolver-policy.md:231:| `TASK-260715-5o6jqg` — Implement exit-side DNS-over-TCP through SSH direct-tcpip | Implement the generation-global active endpoint, one connection epoch, correlation/tombstones, atomic in-flight classification, one coordinated retry batch/promotion, late-epoch rejection, policy byte reservations, cache invalidation, and typed health loss. |
./.research/260721_task-260715-1tnjlu-exit-dns-resolver-policy.md:232:| `TASK-260715-1e0x1u` / `TASK-260715-2hawz9` — DNS listener and cache/fallback | Accept only QUERY; key cache generation by resolver identity; preserve DNSSEC semantics; return bounded SERVFAIL without physical fallback. |
